-- Sync the FIRMWARE_TYPE dictionary to the full set of boards officially
-- supported by the upstream xiaozhi-esp32 firmware repo.
--
-- The initial 202504301341.sql changeSet seeded only the 54 board variants
-- that existed when this fork was cut. Upstream has since grown to 181 build
-- variants under main/boards/**/config.json (each build name is the exact
-- string a device reports as board.type/board.name). This changeSet upserts
-- the complete list so a fresh setup ships the same boards the upstream repo
-- and xiaozhi.ai console present.
--
-- Naming convention is enforced upstream (docs/custom-board.md): board names
-- are lowercase letters, digits, periods and hyphens only -- no underscores.
-- Every value below is a verbatim config.json build name.
--
-- Idempotent: ids not present are inserted; existing ids are refreshed.
